    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "FireAct leverages few-shot prompting of a strong language model to generate diverse ReAct trajectories, which are then used to fine-tune a smaller language model. During inference, the fine-tuned language model can operate without few-shot prompting and implicitly select a suitable prompting method. The approach promotes data diversity by mixing multiple training tasks and prompting methods, such as Chain of Thought and Reflexion.",
